          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十一章 细胞工程技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.838,
            0.058,
            0.873,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "205"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.091,
            0.904,
            0.131
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（6）将样品转移到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的试管中，加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\mathrm{ml}56\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的蔗糖溶液，制成 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "40\\% (w / w)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的蔗糖溶液。颠倒离心管，混匀悬浮液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.134,
            0.907,
            0.174
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（7）将样品置于SW40的离心管中，依次用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8.5\\mathrm{ml}35\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 蔗糖溶液和 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.5\\mathrm{ml}56\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 蔗糖溶液浸没样品。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.177,
            0.905,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（8）在 39 000r/min（271 000g）的转速下，用 SW40 离心机离心 18h。离心时，DRM 浮于上层。用平滑的吸液管小心收集 2.5ml 上清液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.219,
            0.907,
            0.281
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（9）按 1:4 的比例加入 7.5ml TNE 稀释上清液，转移至另一个 SW40 离心管中。接着用 SW40 离心机以 24 000r/min（100 000g）的转速离心 2h，可从沉淀中获得浓缩的 DRM。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.293,
            0.575,
            0.313
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）用线性蔗糖梯度浮选法分析 DRM"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.325,
            0.448,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "步骤（1）～（6）与（一）相同。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.348,
            0.907,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（7）在一个 SW40 离心管中准备 5%～35% 的线性蔗糖梯度，每个浓度 4.5ml。冷却到 4℃。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.389,
            0.908,
            0.43
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（8）用巴氏吸液管将样品放入蔗糖梯度中，尽可能减少对梯度的干扰（或者可以先将样品放入SW40离心管，再覆盖不同浓度梯度的蔗糖）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.432,
            0.909,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（9）用 SW40 离心机在 39 000r/min（271 000g）的转速下离心 18h。在梯度上层收集 12 份 1ml 上清液，然后用 1mlTNE 制成悬浮液。9～12 份含有可溶材料，DRM 则在更轻的部分中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.506,
            0.701,
            0.527
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（三）用 OptiPrep 不连续梯度浮选的方法分析 DRM"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.538,
            0.242,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.559,
            0.617,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) PBS,  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\times"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  TNE, TNE, TNE + (配法同上)。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.582,
            0.908,
            0.622
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ("
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\omega / V"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ") Triton X-100: 称取 1g Triton X-100, 用 2ml "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\times"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " TNE 溶解, 最后用双蒸水定容至 10ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.625,
            0.909,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ("
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\omega / V"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ") 碘克沙醇。5ml 碘克沙醇的配制方法:将 2.5ml OptiPrep、1ml "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\times"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " TNE 和 1.5ml 双蒸水混合。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.667,
            0.201,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.688,
            0.75,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 培养 MDCK Ⅱ细胞，使之在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3.5 \\mathrm{~cm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 塑料组织培养皿中铺满。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.71,
            0.687,
            0.729
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 下移去培养基, 用 PBS 和 TNE 各洗一次细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.731,
            0.561,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）收集细胞并颠倒混匀 [与（一）相同]。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.753,
            0.909,
            0.792
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）用  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "200\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  TNE+重新将细胞沉淀配制成悬浮液，并使之均质化 [与（一）相同]。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.795,
            0.908,
            0.835
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（5）吸取 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "180\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 细胞悬浮液，放入新的离心管。加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\mu \\mathrm{l}10\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的TritonX-100作为溶剂，混匀并在冰上放置 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.838,
            0.909,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（6）加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "400 \\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " OptiPrep，使样品置于 40% (w/V) 碘克沙醇溶液中。颠倒离心管，使溶液充分混匀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.881,
            0.911,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 将样品放于 TLS55 离心管中，依次用 1.2ml 30% 碘克沙醇溶液和 0.2ml TNE"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
