            0.424,
            0.056,
            0.589,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.091,
            0.255,
            0.109
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "溶液浸没样品。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.113,
            0.898,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（8）用 TLS55 离心机在 55 000r/min（259 000g）的转速下离心 2h，收集两次组分，每次各 1ml。最上面的一份中含有 DRM。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.165,
            0.435,
            0.185
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（四）活细胞胆固醇的去除"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.198,
            0.234,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.219,
            0.901,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 20mmol/L 洛伐他丁。配制 2.5ml 洛伐他丁的方法:在 0.5ml 100% 的乙醇和 0.5ml 0.1mol/L 的 NaOH 中溶解 20mg 洛伐他丁。在 50℃ 下放置 2h。用冰稍冷却，用 HCl 调 pH 至 7.2。取 2.5ml 以上溶液至双蒸水中，在 -20℃ 下贮存分装好的溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.283,
            0.902,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 50mmol/L 甲羟戊酸。配制 5mL 甲羟戊酸的方法:在 5mlPBS 中溶解 325mg 甲羟戊酸，在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 下贮存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.326,
            0.901,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 100mmol/L 甲基-β-环糊精（MEM 为溶剂）:在 MEM 中溶解 150mg 甲基-β-环糊精，再用 MEM 定容至 1ml。使用前配制。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.369,
            0.195,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.39,
            0.901,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）用塑料组织培养皿培养 MDCK Ⅱ细胞。实验前的 48h 在普通培养基中加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4\\mu mol/L"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  洛伐他丁（将原溶液稀释至 1:5000）和 0.25mmol/L 甲羟戊酸（将原溶液稀释至 1:2000），用此培养基培养 MDCK Ⅱ细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.453,
            0.902,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）用 PBS 和加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4\\mu mol/L"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  洛伐他丁、0.25mmol/L 甲羟戊酸和 10mmol/L 甲基- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -环糊精的 MEM 溶液冲洗细胞 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.496,
            0.399,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 孵育细胞 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.527,
            0.484,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（五）细胞匀浆中胆固醇的去除"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.56,
            0.237,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 溶液配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.582,
            0.78,
            0.6
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) PBS, TNE, TNE+, 10% 的 Triton X-100; 见（一）和（三）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.603,
            0.903,
            0.644
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mathrm{mmol / L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲基- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -环糊精（以TNE作为溶剂）。 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的配制方法:在TNE中溶解 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\mathrm{mg}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲基- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -环糊精，再用TNE定容至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。使用前配制。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.646,
            0.197,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.667,
            0.444,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "步骤（1）～（4）与（三）相同。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.688,
            0.904,
            0.728
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（5）吸取  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "160 \\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  细胞悬浮液至一个新的离心管。加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20 \\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "   "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100 mmol/L"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  甲基- "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\beta"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " -环糊精，混匀， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  孵育 30 min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.732,
            0.904,
            0.771
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（6）接下来的 DRM 分析时，冷却至  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\mu l\\ 10\\% Triton\\ X-100"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，在冰上放置 30min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.775,
            0.905,
            0.835
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（7）加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "440\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " OptiPrep，使溶液碘克沙醇浓度为 40% (w/V)。混匀后，吸取  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "600\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，将样品放于 TLS55 离心管中，依次用 1.2ml30% 碘克沙醇溶液和 0.2ml TNE 溶液浸没样品。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.838,
            0.221,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "说明:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.859,
            0.907,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）分离DRM，用密度梯度浮选的方法从可溶于去污剂的物质中分离的方法的比从沉淀中分离的方法更优越。从去污剂中提取DRM沉淀可能会导致DRM被其他可沉"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.401,
            0.054,
            0.602,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十一章 细胞工程技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.828,
            0.055,
            0.863,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "207"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.09,
            0.374,
            0.108
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "淀物，如细胞骨架成分污染。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.111,
            0.897,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）根据不同的实验目的，可以选用不同的浮选梯度做 DRM 的分析。连续梯度浮选可以提供更多蛋白质和脂质反应特征的信息，但是，要在稍后监控 DRM 成分的改变，如用环糊精处理，可以使用许多不同密度梯度的媒介，也可以根据个人需要选择蔗糖或者 OptiPrep。但是，当要采用一种非常灵敏的方法，如质量光谱测定，分析脂质的时候，选用蔗糖可能更加优越。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.218,
            0.899,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 关于如何应用环糊精的问题, 这主要根据选用的细胞类型确定。海马趾神经细胞在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\mathrm{mmol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 环糊精中暴露时间不能超过 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (Simons et al., 1998), 而 MDCK 细胞则可在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20 \\mathrm{mmol} / \\mathrm{L}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 环糊精处理 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\mathrm{~h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的情况下保持完整。因此, 环糊精的处理条件在不同的实验中要进行修改。特别是在只需分离胆固醇这一种脂质的情况下要确定好这个条件。活细胞处理优先从细胞质膜上分离出胆固醇, 用细胞间的胆固醇运输抵消环式糊精的作用。而从细胞悬浮液中分离胆固醇将会影响所有的细胞膜。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.354,
            0.261,
            0.377
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.388,
            0.9,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）膜在去污剂中的可溶性取决于去污剂对脂质的摩尔比率。因此，这个参数比起单独的去污剂浓度，更需要考虑在内。在 Triton X-100 的条件下，去污剂对蛋白质的质量比（作为去污剂对脂质的摩尔比率的一个度量指标）大于 5:1，这对增大溶解度似乎是必要的（Ostermeyer et al., 1999）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.474,
            0.9,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 为了避免 DRM 被去污剂分子和可溶性脂类污染，确保去污剂胶体与 DRM 在所用的离心条件下分离是很关键的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.517,
            0.898,
            0.557
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）Triton 在梯度中的分布可以用 280nm 下的吸光度测定。对其他去污剂而言，它们的分布可以用色谱中的层析半定量确定。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.567,
            0.209,
            0.59
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.602,
            0.688,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 简述去污剂膜蛋白分离的作用机理。如何选择去污剂？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.623,
            0.901,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 试比较线性蔗糖梯度浮选法分析 DRM 与 OptiPrep 不连续梯度浮选的方法分析 DRM 有何不同?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.813,
            0.688,
            0.899,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(何炎明)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
